# Frontend UI

- Customer routes live under `src/app/(pages)/(main-pages)/`; owner routes live under `(private-routes)/` with `onboarding` and `dashboard`.
- Login/OTP always lands customer/global (salon store cleared). Post-login destination: `resolvePostLoginRedirect()` (`redirectUrl` then `?callback=` / session). Use `getLoginHref(returnPath)` for auth CTAs.
- Dashboard without salon JWT: preferred or single membership → auto `switch-context`; multiple → in-layout «انتخاب سالن». Memberships from `GET /api/auth/me` via `AuthMeMembershipsSyncProvider`.
- Owner dashboard phase-8 surfaces: `/dashboard/catalog`, `/dashboard/staff-services`, `/dashboard/schedules` for catalog, staff assignment, and schedules.
- Owner dashboard salon profile edit: `/dashboard/salon-info` («اطلاعات سالن»); `/onboarding` remains create/resume-draft only.
- Owner dashboard phase-9 surfaces: `/dashboard/finance` and `/dashboard/z-report`; customer wallet page `/wallet` must render real balance/transactions.
- Owner dashboard analytics: `/dashboard/analytics` (`GET /api/reports/dashboard-summary` KPI cards + sparkline) and `/dashboard/reports` (financial/staff/CRM breakdowns + CSV export).
- Owner dashboard phase-10 surfaces: `/dashboard/payouts` and `/dashboard/notifications`; customer notifications at `/notifications`.
- Customer favorites: `/favorites` plus heart toggle on catalog/search/detail cards (`salonPublicId` Guid). Bottom nav includes Favorites.
- Subscription operational lock: dashboard banner + quick-book disabled when `GET /api/subscriptions/me/entitlement` has `isEntitled=false`. Online booking maps `errors.field=subscription` to a customer-facing lock message. Cancel/complete stay unlocked.
- Never add platform admin UI to this SPA; admin surface is explicitly deferred/out of scope (`api/admin/*`, approve/reject salons, hide media, user management).
- Owner dashboard chrome: sticky header (salon name, back to customer app, notifications) + 4-item owner bottom nav (امروز / بینش / عملیات / مالی) with in-group subtabs. Customer `BottomNavigation` stays customer-only. Dashboard shell max width is `720px`; onboarding stays `600px`.
- Shared owner UI lives in `dashboard/_components/` (`DashboardPage`, `DashboardCard`, `DashboardSelect`, `DashboardDateField`, empty/skeleton/toast). Do not use the broken shared `Select.tsx` in dashboard.
- Icons: `@phosphor-icons/react` or `lucide-react` — never `@radix-ui/react-icons` (not installed).
- Use real theme tokens from `globals.css`: `bg-surface` for cards; `bg-input` / `border-input-border` / `text-foreground` for fields; `text-foreground-muted` for secondary text; primary green for accents. Avoid ghost tokens (`bg-surface-tertiary`, `text-content-*`) — they are not defined.
- Money = Toman; dates = Jalali in UI, `yyyy-MM-dd` / ISO toward the API.
- Do not ship mock identity, fake businesses, or crypto-style wallet placeholders when wiring real APIs.
